@startuml F5.6-D04-reset-senha
title F5.6-D04 — Reset de senha administrativo
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "StudentController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Confirmar reset
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /admin/usuarios/{id}/reset-senha
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: outbox link JWT\n+ audit_log
note right of Ctrl
  operadora não vê senha;
  sem senha temporária (CA-04)
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK (COMMIT)
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Sec: confirmação

@enduml
